{"name":"work/50-batch","commit":{"sha":"0f56cf81226b1347c4ed00824461e138d5a16038","node_id":"C_kwDOVGREgNoAKDBmNTZjZjgxMjI2YjEzNDdjNGVkMDA4MjQ0NjFlMTM4ZDVhMTYwMzg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Joshua Azimullah","email":"35622390+djosh34@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-13T08:36:16Z"},"committer":{"name":"Joshua Azimullah","email":"35622390+djosh34@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-10-13T08:36:16Z"},"message":"Fix the review findings on batch admission\n\nA due batch is handed over before every frame read, stream errors and\ncontinued header blocks included. Complete takes a lock of its own, so\nthe committer never waits on a connection. SubmitBatch refuses work once\nthe node stopped, and a stopping node's last replies are sent before the\ncalls it still held fail. Calls hold their request, a fixed cost and\ntheir reply until the reply is sent; above 64 MiB the connection window\nis not credited back, so the reader never blocks on it.","tree":{"sha":"0943787ecfdaca291a5139a114492ca22690b1c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djosh34/tigerstore/git/trees/0943787ecfdaca291a5139a114492ca22690b1c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djosh34/tigerstore/git/commits/0f56cf81226b1347c4ed00824461e138d5a16038","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djosh34/tigerstore/commits/0f56cf81226b1347c4ed00824461e138d5a16038","html_url":"https://github.com/djosh34/tigerstore/commit/0f56cf81226b1347c4ed00824461e138d5a16038","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djosh34/tigerstore/commits/0f56cf81226b1347c4ed00824461e138d5a16038/comments","author":{"login":"djosh34","id":35622390,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NjIyMzkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35622390?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djosh34","html_url":"https://github.com/djosh34","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djosh34/followers","